OL,3,GNEWSA#16m revamp to bring 'new era' for
OL,4,Ashopping centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has started on a #16m revamp of
OL,7,FSalford's "struggling" shopping centre
OL,8,Fwith the changes billed as a "new era"
OL,9,Ffor the site, its director has said.
OL,11,FA GoKarting track and bowling alley are
OL,12,Fexpected to open in Quayside Salford
OL,13,Fnext year as part of the cash
OL,14,Finjection.
OL,16,FThe centre currently has a large number
OL,17,Fof empty retail shops, with the project
OL,18,Fhoped to broaden what is on offer,
OL,19,Fincluding more experience and
OL,20,Factivity-based businesses alongside
OL,21,Ftraditional shops.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
