OL,3,GNEWSA#16m revamp to bring 'new era' for
OL,4,Ashopping centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FBen Hey, asset director at Peel Retail
OL,7,Fand Leisure, which owns and operates
OL,8,FQuayside, said it marked "an important
OL,9,Fmoment" for the shopping centre.
